<title>POLAND: Agros H1 net rises to PLN 15.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Agros H1 net rises to PLN 15.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agros Holding SA results for period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  H1 1996    H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating				 12.08 vs    8.97</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   21.42 vs   14.27</p>
<p>    net					 15.21 vs    9.03</p>
<p>    net sales				 54.41 vs   79.58</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  45.23 vs   62.96</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 6.21 vs    5.23</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     9.15 vs    9.21</p>
<p>    financial costs			  5.55 vs    4.00</p>
<p>    investment				 0.40 vs    0.72</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
